  "title": "Tex Mex Potato Soup",
  "description": "A puree of potatoes boiled in chicken broth is added to a saute of mixed peppers, chilies, and ham in this spicy soup cooked with heavy cream and egg yolk. Serve with shredded cheddar cheese.",
  "authors": [
